{"id":"348361ab4be85a8d","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-compactness-property.md","title":"Compactness Property","display":"df-compactness-property — Compactness Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-compactness-property","aliases":["57-df-compactness-property"],"display":"df-compactness-property — Compactness Property","depends_on":["[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","[[57-df-finite-subset]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-compactness-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-compactness-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compactness-property — Compactness Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f570926126f9a186\" href=\"?note=f570926126f9a186\" title=\"57-df-finite-subset\">57-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为所讨论的一阶字母表类，包含所需的子字母表、重命名和有限/可数新常量扩张。一个语义逻辑表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\\)</span> 为给定数据：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\)</span> 是句子集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\mathcal L,S}:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\times\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(V_{\\mathcal L,S}:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\times\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是类函数，且同构结构上的同一句取值相同。类量词按背景类理论或固定宇宙解释。该表示不是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"337462c47a6e0696\" href=\"?note=337462c47a6e0696\" title=\"57-df-abstract-logic\">57-df-abstract-logic</a> 的代数—闭包二元组；若从该对象出发，必须额外给定此语义数据，不能凭同名推断。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span> 为句子集原简写，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S),\\qquad\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow V_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\mathfrak A,\\sigma)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal L(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S),\\qquad\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow V_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\mathfrak A,\\sigma)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(|\\Phi_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi_0))\\right)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(|\\Phi_0|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi_0))\\right)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 Compact 的原数学条件，补全它实际需要的签名、句子域和逻辑下标。AAL 定义原封不动；语义逻辑表示在本文件供依赖条目共用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"f570926126f9a186","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"337462c47a6e0696","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal V$ 为所讨论的一阶字母表类，包含所需的子字母表、重命名和有限/可数新常量扩张。一个语义逻辑表示 $\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle$ 为给定数据：对每个 $S\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)$ 是句子集合，$V_{\\mathcal L,S}:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\times\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是类函数，且同构结构上的同一句取值相同。类量词按背景类理论或固定宇宙解释。该表示不是 [[57-df-abstract-logic]] 的代数—闭包二元组；若从该对象出发，必须额外给定此语义数据，不能凭同名推断。$\\mathcal L(S)$ 为句子集原简写，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L},V_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"V_{\\mathcal L,S}:\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\times\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sen}_{\\mathcal L}(S),\\qquad\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma\\leftrightarrow V_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\mathfrak A,\\sigma)=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\sigma),\\qquad\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\Phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall S\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal L(S)\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall\\Phi_0\\subseteq\\Phi\\;(|\\Phi_0|<\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi_0))\\right)\\to\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L,S}(\\Phi)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d3445b68d4cfbdb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L,\\mathcal V,\\models_{\\mathcal L}$ 取 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的明确语义表示。对 $S\\in\\mathcal V$ 和 $n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S(\\vec c)$ 在 $S$ 上加入互异新常量 $c_1,\\ldots,c_n$；对 $\\vec a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n$，$\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}$ 是同载体扩张，$c_i^{\\mathfrak A_{\\vec a}}=a_i$，其他符号解释不变。$\\preceq_{\\mathcal L}$ 用这些有限参数命名的句子定义；$\\subseteq$ 是一阶子结构关系。$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$ 为 [[57-df-cardinal]] 的基数谓词，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 为载体基数，$|S|$ 为总字母表基数。"},{"id":"9df274d8ffd46989","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为一阶字母表。$\\mathrm{FO}(Q_{\\aleph_1})$ 是下式有限语法及语义给出的扩展，不是结构。$Q_{\\aleph_1}$ 是新绑定构造子；$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists,Q_{\\aleph_1}\\}$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$。$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$；赋值修改取 [[57-df-modified-assignment]]。原一阶公式满足按 [[57-df-satisfaction]] 嵌入；递归按有限公式树进行。逻辑表示的格式取 [[57-df-compactness-property]]。"},{"id":"354237a63abf2017","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8737fa3880e12e6f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"20192e1fbe7f3ae7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 满足 [[57-thm-lindstrom]] 的全部显式语义框架、闭合及 FO 扩张前提。$\\mathrm{DownLS}(\\mathcal L)$。$\\equiv,\\mathrm{FO},\\ge$ 均取该文件的形式定义；$\\mathrm{Compact}$ 见 [[57-df-compactness-property]]。"},{"id":"b1c18a144a85b6d5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 采用 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示；$\\mathcal V$ 包含全部所需一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{DLS},\\mathrm{DownLS}$ 取 [[57-df-downward-LS-property]]。假定以下条件作为本定理的前提："},{"id":"e4d9ab0f9e9545c9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 的唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$；$S'$ 在 $S$ 上加入两列互异新常量 $(c_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$、$(d_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$。$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；集合合取、析取及句子语义取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]。$\\sigma_{\\mathrm{wf}}$ 下式指定载体恰由 $d_n$ 枚举且序型为 $\\omega$，不是声称一般良基性可由一个无穷句子定义。$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S')$。作为 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，$L_{\\omega_1\\omega}$ 的句子域为 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}$，真值取 $\\models_\\infty$。"},{"id":"3f589aad5d527efc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b669992ec0ec3e08","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{c\\}$，$c$ 为新常量，其他分区不变。$\\Phi_{\\mathrm{PA2}}$ 取 [[57-thm-so-nat]] 并按同一语法嵌入扩张语言；$\\overline n$ 为 [[57-df-numeral]] 的数码。$\\mathrm{SO}$ 是 [[57-df-compactness-property]] 的语义表示，其句子集为 $\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$、真值由完全二阶语义给定。$\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathrm{SO},S}$ 取该表示的可满足性。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]